// template: Full Moon
// order: 1
// Full-on psytrance: a short kick tuned to the root, a rolling bass on the three 16ths
// after each kick (never on it), a resonant acid sequence in phrygian, a screaming lead in
// the drop and delayed zaps. Every melody is original.
title "Full Moon"
tempo 145
key f# phrygian
kick:    kick       sharp    x... x... x... x...                                   | pitch 46 | decay 0.16 | drive 0.5 | gain 0.9
bass:    bass       dirty    . f#1 f#1 f#1 . f#1 f#1 f#1 . f#1 f#1 f#1 . f#1 f#1 f#1 / . f#1 f#1 f#1 . f#1 f#1 f#1 . f#1 f#1 f#1 . f#1 f#1 f#1 / . f#1 f#1 f#1 . f#1 f#1 f#1 . f#1 f#1 f#1 . f#1 f#1 f#1 / . f#1 f#1 f#1 . f#1 f#1 f#1 . g1 g1 g1 . a1 a1 g1   | decay 0.09 | cutoff sine(16) 500..1400 | drive 0.4 | gain 0.75
hat:     hat        tight    . x x x . x x x . x x x . x x x                       | gain 0.35 | pan 0.2
ohat:    hat        dusty    ..x. ..x. ..x. ..x.                                   | gain 0.4 | pan -0.15
clap:    clap       snap     .... x... .... x...                                   | reverb small | gain 0.55
ride:    ride       ping     x.x. x.x. x.x. x.x. | pan 0.3 | gain 0.3
zap:     perc       drop     .... .... ..x. .... / .... .... .... ..x. / .... ..x. .... .... / .... .... .... x.x.   | delay 3/16 | reverb wide | pan -0.35 | gain 0.4
acid:    acid       soft     f#2 f#2 f#3 f#2 g2 f#2 a2 f#2 f#2 c#3 f#2 b2 f#2 g2 f#3 e3 / f#2 f#2 f#3 f#2 a2 f#2 g2 f#2 d3 f#2 c#3 f#2 b2 a2 g2 f#2   | cutoff saw(16) 300..4200 | resonance 0.8 | delay 3/16 | pan 0.15 | gain 0.55
lead:    lead       screamer     f#4 ~ g4 a4 c#5 ~ b4 a4 / g4 ~ ~ f#4 e4 ~ f#4 ~ / f#4 ~ g4 a4 d5 ~ c#5 b4 / a4 ~ g4 ~ f#4 ~ ~ ~   | cutoff sine(8) 900..3200 | delay 3/16 | reverb wide | gain 0.49
pad:     pad        void     F#m ~ ~ ~ / G ~ ~ ~ / F#m ~ ~ ~ / Em ~ ~ ~             | brightness sine(16) 0.2..0.55 | reverb sea | gain 0.5
choir:   choir      dark     F#m ~ ~ ~ / G ~ ~ ~ / F#m ~ ~ ~ / Em ~ ~ ~             | reverb small | gain 0.35
rise:    noise      white    x~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~                                   | cutoff saw(8) 300..10000 | gain saw(8) 0.15..0.5
riser:   riser      both     x... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....   | length 13.2 | gain 0.5
down:    downlifter noise    x~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....   | reverb wide | gain 0.6
crash:   crash      short    x... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....   | reverb wide | gain 0.45
impact:  impact     deep     x... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....   | reverb sea | gain 0.7
section intro   kick hat ohat zap
section groove  kick bass hat ohat clap zap | loop
section acid    kick bass hat ohat clap ride zap acid
section build   kick hat clap zap acid rise riser
section break   pad choir acid down
section drop    kick bass hat ohat clap ride zap acid lead crash impact
section groove2 kick bass hat ohat clap ride acid
section break2  pad choir lead down
section drop2   kick bass hat ohat clap ride zap acid lead choir crash impact
section outro   kick hat ohat zap
song intro 16, groove 32, acid 32, build 8, break 16, build 8, drop 32, groove2 16, break2 16, build 8, drop2 32, outro 16
